#: ../developer/database.md:120
msgid ""
"`api_logs.session_id` is what groups one conversation's requests "
"together, and it is indexed for exactly that lookup. A client sets it "
"with the gateway's own `X-Session-ID` header — but no coding agent sends "
"that header, so the traffic the column is most useful on used to arrive "
"unlabelled. Each agent does carry a session of its own, in its own idiom,"
" and the gateway reads whichever one the request used:"
msgstr ""
"`api_logs.session_id` 就是把同一段对话的请求归到一起的那一列，索引也正是为这种查询建的。客户端可以用网关自己的 `X"
"-Session-ID` 头来设置它——但没有哪个编程 agent 会发这个头，于是这一列最该发挥作用的那部分流量，过去反而都是没有标记的。每个 "
"agent 其实都带着自己的会话标识，只是各有各的写法；网关会按请求实际用的那一种去读："

