#: ../developer/database.md:135
msgid ""
"Those clients have two request paths, and only one of them sends the "
"headers. The older `packages/opencode` path builds them directly; the "
"newer `packages/core/src/session/runner/llm.ts` runner lost them and got "
"them back upstream in `sst/opencode#43188` (2026-08-18). Kilo Code forked"
" before that restore, so its core runner — the one `location-services.ts`"
" registers — still sends nothing, and nothing else on the wire names the "
"session. The gateway records none rather than inferring one from a field "
"that was not meant to carry it."
msgstr ""
"这些客户端有两条请求路径，只有其中一条会发会话头。较旧的 `packages/opencode` 路径直接构造这些头；较新的 "
"`packages/core/src/session/runner/llm.ts` runner 一度把它们弄丢了，上游在 "
"`sst/opencode#43188`（2026-08-18）中才补回来。Kilo Code 是在那次修复之前分叉的，所以它的 core "
"runner——也就是 `location-services.ts` "
"注册的那个——至今什么都不发，链路上也没有别的东西能指明这次会话。这时网关宁可什么都不记，也不从一个本就不是用来承载会话的字段里去推断。"

#: ../developer/database.md:144
msgid ""
"There is no client-side workaround for that path, and it is worth being "
"exact about why: the `chat.headers` plugin hook exists only on the older "
"path, which already sends the headers. Where the hook exists the fix is "
"unnecessary, and where the headers are missing there is no hook to add "
"them with. Upgrading OpenCode past the restore fixes OpenCode; Kilo needs"
" the same change ported into its fork."
msgstr ""
"这条路径没有客户端侧的绕行办法，而且值得把原因说准：`chat.headers` "
"插件钩子只存在于那条较旧的路径上，而那条路径本来就已经在发这些头了。有钩子的地方不需要修，缺头的地方又没有钩子可用。把 OpenCode "
"升级到那次修复之后即可解决 OpenCode；Kilo 则需要把同一个改动移植进它自己的分叉。"

#: ../developer/database.md:151
msgid ""
"The admin console's Recent Requests view shows the session under each "
"row's client, and clicking it filters the list to that one conversation —"
" an exact match against the indexed column, so it stays a lookup rather "
"than a scan."
msgstr ""
"管理控制台的 Recent Requests "
"视图会把会话显示在每一行的客户端下方，点一下就把列表过滤成那一段对话——这里走的是对索引列的精确匹配，所以它始终是一次查找，而不是一次扫描。"

#: ../developer/database.md:155
msgid ""
"`metadata.session_id_source` on the same row names which of those it came"
" from, so a value read out of a composite id is never mistaken for one a "
"client declared under the documented header. Every source is client-"
"supplied, and nothing is authorized, billed or rate-limited by a session "
"id; a declaration over 128 characters, or one carrying control "
"characters, is dropped rather than recorded. Like the derived columns "
"above, the session is recorded whether or not `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` is "
"on: it is a label the client put on the request, not part of the "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"同一行上的 `metadata.session_id_source` 会写明这个值是从哪一处读来的，这样从复合 id "
"里解析出来的值，就不会被误当成客户端在那个文档化的头里显式声明的值。所有来源都由客户端提供，而且不会有任何鉴权、计费或限流依赖会话 id；超过 "
"128 个字符、或者带控制字符的声明会被丢弃，而不是记录下来。和上面那些派生列一样，无论 `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` "
"是否打开，会话都会被记录：它是客户端贴在请求上的标签，而不是对话内容的一部分。"

#: ../developer/database.md:164
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "备份"

#: ../developer/database.md:166
msgid "`pg_dump` in custom format, straight out of the container:"
msgstr "直接从容器里做 custom 格式的 `pg_dump`："

#: ../developer/database.md:173
msgid ""
"Do not add `-t` to `docker exec`: allocating a TTY corrupts the binary "
"stream."
msgstr "不要给 `docker exec` 加 `-t`：分配 TTY 会破坏二进制流。"

#: ../developer/database.md:175
msgid "Restore into an existing, running database:"
msgstr "恢复到一个已存在且正在运行的数据库："

#: ../developer/database.md:182
msgid ""
"Stop the backend (`make down`, or `docker stop hybridinference-backend`) "
"before restoring over a live database, and remember that the backup "
"contains hashed API keys and — if `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` was ever on — "
"user prompt content. Store it accordingly."
msgstr ""
"覆盖一个在线数据库之前，先停掉 backend（`make down`，或者 `docker stop hybridinference-"
"backend`），并且记住：备份里含有哈希后的 API key，以及——只要 `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT` "
"曾经打开过——用户的 prompt 内容。请按相应的密级保管。"

#: ../developer/database.md:187
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

#: ../developer/database.md:189
msgid ""
"Deleting the database is more awkward than it looks, because the Postgres"
" volume is declared `external:` in `deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml`:"
msgstr ""
"删掉数据库比看上去别扭，因为 Postgres 的卷在 `deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` 里声明为 "
"`external:`："

#: ../developer/database.md:199
msgid ""
"**`docker compose down --volumes` does not delete an external volume.** "
"Nor does `make down`, which passes no `--volumes` at all. A reset that "
"relies on either silently leaves every row in place. Delete the volume by"
" name:"
msgstr ""
"**`docker compose down --volumes` 不会删除外部卷**。`make down` 也不会，它压根没传 "
"`--volumes`。依赖这两者中任何一个的「重置」，都会静默地把每一行数据原样留在那里。要按名字删除这个卷："

#: ../developer/database.md:209
msgid ""
"`make up` depends on the `docker-volumes` target, which recreates the "
"named volume if it is missing, so the stack comes back on an empty "
"database and the startup initialisers rebuild the schema. Take a dump "
"first if there is any chance you want the data back."
msgstr ""
"`make up` 依赖 `docker-volumes` 这个 "
"target，具名卷缺失时它会重新创建，于是整套栈在一个空数据库上起来，由启动时的初始化逻辑重建表结构。只要还有一丝想把数据找回来的可能，就先做一份"
" dump。"

#: ../developer/database.md:214
msgid ""
"The runnable example (`make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`) uses its "
"own, example-scoped volume and cannot delete "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data`."
msgstr ""
"那个可运行的示例（`make demo-reset DISTRIBUTION=example`）用的是它自己的、限定在 example "
"范围内的卷，删不掉 `hybridinference_postgres_data`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:217
msgid "Inspecting the database"
msgstr "查看数据库"

#: ../developer/database.md:223
msgid ""
"Useful starting points: `\\dt` for the table list and `\\d api_logs` for "
"the request log's columns. `make ps` shows the published bindings — "
"Postgres and pgAdmin should both read `127.0.0.1:...`; anything else "
"means the database is listening beyond this host."
msgstr ""
"几个好用的起点：`\\dt` 看表清单，`\\d api_logs` 看请求日志的列。`make ps` 会列出发布出来的绑定——Postgres"
" 和 pgAdmin 都应该显示成 `127.0.0.1:...`；不是这样就说明数据库在这台机器之外也在监听。"

#: ../developer/database.md:228
msgid "Optional: pgAdmin"
msgstr "可选：pgAdmin"

#: ../developer/database.md:230
msgid ""
"The Compose stack ships a pgAdmin service for people who prefer a GUI. It"
" is **profile-gated** — nothing starts it unless the `admin` profile is "
"named — and it is entirely optional; `psql` above does everything."
msgstr ""
"Compose 栈里带了一个 pgAdmin 服务，给偏好图形界面的人用。它由 **profile 把关**——不点名 `admin` "
"profile 就没有任何东西会启动它——而且它完全可选；上面的 `psql` 什么都能做。"

#: ../developer/database.md:234
msgid "Starting and restarting it"
msgstr "启动与重启"

#: ../developer/database.md:236
msgid "The profile must be on *every* Compose command, not just the first:"
msgstr "这个 profile 必须出现在*每一条* Compose 命令上，不只是第一条："

#: ../developer/database.md:243
msgid ""
"Omitting it does not fail loudly, it just does the wrong thing in both "
"directions: a plain `make up` starts every other service and skips "
"pgAdmin, and a plain `make down` leaves the pgAdmin container running "
"while removing everything around it (Compose then reports the network as "
"still in use). Pass `COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin` on both halves of a restart."
msgstr ""
"漏掉它不会大声报错，只会在两个方向上都做错事：不带 profile 的 `make up` 会启动其他所有服务、跳过 pgAdmin；不带 "
"profile 的 `make down` 会把周围的一切都删掉，却留着 pgAdmin 容器在跑（然后 Compose "
"报告网络仍在使用中）。重启的两半都要带上 `COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:249
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#: ../developer/database.md:251
msgid "Two independent gates, and by default neither is pgAdmin's own login:"
msgstr "两道互相独立的关卡，而且默认情况下没有一道是 pgAdmin 自己的登录："

#: ../developer/database.md:253
msgid ""
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE` defaults to `False`, which serves pgAdmin "
"with **no login of its own**. Set it to `True` in `.env` and pgAdmin asks"
" for `PGADMIN_EMAIL` / `PGADMIN_PASSWORD` (which themselves default to "
"`admin@local.dev` / `admin` — change them before enabling this)."
msgstr ""
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_SERVER_MODE` 默认为 `False`，这样提供出来的 pgAdmin **自身没有登录**。在 "
"`.env` 里把它设为 `True`，pgAdmin 就会要 `PGADMIN_EMAIL` / "
"`PGADMIN_PASSWORD`（这两个自身的默认值是 `admin@local.dev` / `admin`——启用之前先改掉）。"

#: ../developer/database.md:257
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Reached through the console at `/pgadmin/`, the request is gated on an "
"admin session by a Next.js route handler "
"(`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`), which asks the "
"backend to verify the caller. Reached directly on its published port "
"(`127.0.0.1:${PGADMIN_PORT:-5050}`, loopback only), that gate does not "
"apply — use an SSH tunnel:"
msgstr ""
"从控制台的 `/pgadmin/` 进去时，请求由一个 Next.js route "
"handler（`apps/frontend/src/app/pgadmin/[[...path]]/route.ts`）按管理员会话把关，它会请后端校验调用方。直接走它发布的端口（`127.0.0.1:${PGADMIN_PORT:-5050}`，只监听回环）进去时，这道关卡不生效——请用"
" SSH 隧道："

#: ../developer/database.md:268
msgid ""
"pgAdmin's *master password* prompt never appears: "
"`PGADMIN_CONFIG_MASTER_PASSWORD_REQUIRED` is pinned to `\"False\"` in the"
" Compose file with no environment variable to change it."
msgstr ""
"pgAdmin 的*主密码*（master "
"password）提示永远不会出现：`PGADMIN_CONFIG_MASTER_PASSWORD_REQUIRED` 在 Compose "
"文件里被钉死为 `\"False\"`，而且没有任何环境变量能改它。"

#: ../developer/database.md:272
msgid "Registering the database"
msgstr "注册数据库"

#: ../developer/database.md:274
msgid "`Servers` → right-click → `Register` → `Server`."
msgstr "`Servers` → 右键 → `Register` → `Server`。"

#: ../developer/database.md:275
msgid "**General**: any name."
msgstr "**General**：名字随便起。"

#: ../developer/database.md:276
msgid ""
"**Connection**: host `postgres`, port `5432`, maintenance database "
"`DB_NAME`, username `DB_USER`, password `DB_PASSWORD` — the container-"
"internal values, not the host port mapping."
msgstr ""
"**Connection**：host 填 `postgres`，port 填 `5432`，maintenance database 填 "
"`DB_NAME`，username 填 `DB_USER`，password 填 "
"`DB_PASSWORD`——都用容器内部的值，不是宿主机那侧的端口映射。"

#: ../developer/database.md:280
msgid "Resetting pgAdmin"
msgstr "重置 pgAdmin"

#: ../developer/database.md:282
msgid ""
"Its saved connections live in `hybridinference_pgadmin_data`, an ordinary"
" project-local volume (not external, unlike the Postgres one):"
msgstr ""
"它保存的连接放在 `hybridinference_pgadmin_data`，这是个普通的项目内卷（不像 Postgres 那个卷，它不是 "
"external）："

#~ msgid "`session_id` / `conversation_id` headers"
#~ msgstr "`session_id` / `conversation_id` 头"

#~ msgid "`prompt_cache_key` in the request body"
#~ msgstr "请求体里的 `prompt_cache_key`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "OpenCode and Kilo Code, which set "
#~ "OpenAI's cache-routing hint to their "
#~ "session id. Read last and forwarded "
#~ "upstream untouched — see below"
#~ msgstr "OpenCode 和 Kilo Code，它们把 OpenAI 的缓存路由提示设成了自己的会话 id。最后才读，并且原样转发给上游——见下文"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`prompt_cache_key` is the one source the"
#~ " gateway does not treat as a "
#~ "declaration. The API only asks for "
#~ "a value that groups similar prompts, "
#~ "so a client is free to send "
#~ "one that is constant, and a "
#~ "constant would collapse everything behind "
#~ "it into one apparent session; it "
#~ "therefore loses to every other source."
#~ " It is also the only one that"
#~ " is *not* stripped before the request"
#~ " goes upstream, because it is a "
#~ "real provider parameter that raises the"
#~ " cache hit rate — the gateway "
#~ "reads a label out of it without"
#~ " taking it away."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`prompt_cache_key` 是网关唯一不当作「声明」看待的来源。这个 API "
#~ "只要求传一个能把相似提示词归到一起的值，所以客户端完全可以传一个常量，而常量会把它背后的所有请求塌缩成同一个看似的会话；因此它排在其他所有来源之后。它也是唯一在请求发往上游之前*不*被摘掉的一个，因为它是提供方真正会用到的参数，能提高缓存命中率——网关只是从中读出一个标签，并不把它拿走。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "An OpenCode or Kilo build older "
#~ "than the one that restored those "
#~ "headers (`sst/opencode#43188`, 2026-08-18) sends "
#~ "no session header at all on its"
#~ " newer runner, and nothing else on"
#~ " the wire names the session — "
#~ "the gateway records none rather than "
#~ "inferring one from a field that "
#~ "was not meant to carry it. "
#~ "Upgrading is the fix; on the older"
#~ " runner a `chat.headers` plugin can "
#~ "set `X-Session-ID` from the session "
#~ "id it is handed."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "比恢复这些头的那个版本（`sst/opencode#43188`，2026-08-18）更旧的 OpenCode 或"
#~ " Kilo 构建，在新 runner "
#~ "上根本不发任何会话头，而链路上也没有别的东西能指明这次会话——这时网关宁可什么都不记，也不从一个本就不是用来承载会话的字段里去推断。升级是正解；在旧"
#~ " runner 上，可以用一个 `chat.headers` 插件，把它拿到的会话 "
#~ "id 设成 `X-Session-ID`。"

#~ msgid "Everything the admin UI can change about routing without editing YAML"
#~ msgstr "管理界面不用改 YAML 就能调整的全部路由相关内容"

